---
import type { Locale } from "../../i18n/routes";

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const en = locale === "en";
const copy = en
  ? {
      intro:
        "Adapt this structure to your relationship and process. Keep only what is accurate and appropriate to share. Bracketed text is a prompt to replace or remove.",
      label: "Adaptable letter template",
      community: "Community or cultural organisation",
      address: "Postal address",
      place: "City, country and date",
      institution: "Institution or custodian and address",
      subject: "request for restitution or return of…",
      salutation: "Dear [name or institutional team],",
      mandate: "Representation and mandate",
      withMandate: "Where there is a collective mandate",
      mandateText:
        "We write as [community, family or organisation], represented by [people and roles], under a mandate agreed through [process or decision]. This request concerns [person or entity], connected with [territory or community].",
      forming: "Where a collective mandate is still being formed",
      formingText:
        "We write as [person or group] to begin a conversation about [person or entity]. We are still identifying the relevant authorities and relationships. Please share the information needed to support that process and avoid treating this initial contact as a final collective mandate.",
      relationship: "Relationship and meaning",
      relationshipText:
        "Describe the relationship, meaning, names and knowledge that the community has decided may be shared. Do not include restricted or sacred knowledge without authorisation.",
      history: "History and separation",
      historyText:
        "Describe what is known about separation, including sources, dates and uncertainties. If the history is not yet clear, say so.",
      request: "What we are asking for",
      requestText:
        "We request [specific action: information, access, suspension of an activity, transfer of title or restitution]. We would like [desired outcome or conditions] to be considered by [responsible decision-making body].",
      interim: "While the process continues",
      interimText:
        "For example: pause display, sampling, publication or other use while this request is considered, where appropriate.",
      records: "Information and records",
      recordsText:
        "Please provide the complete associated record, including acquisition documents, earlier inventories, correspondence, photographs, research, conservation records, samples and derived data where relevant.",
      next: "Next steps and response",
      nextText:
        "Please confirm receipt, name the people and body responsible for the decision, explain the applicable process and provide a timetable for the next response by [date].",
      attachments: "Possible supporting material",
      attachItems: [
        "A community or organisational statement describing who is represented and the scope of the mandate.",
        "A decision or record from the relevant authority, where available.",
        "A note describing how additional families, authorities or knowledge holders will be consulted.",
      ],
      closing:
        "We welcome respectful dialogue and ask that it lead to clear responsibilities, decisions and steps.",
      signoff: "Sincerely,",
      signature: "Names, roles and signatures as appropriate",
      print: "Print or save this template",
    }
  : {
      intro:
        "Adapta esta estructura a tu relación y a tu proceso. Conserva solo lo que sea correcto y pertinente compartir. El texto entre corchetes es una indicación que puedes reemplazar o eliminar.",
      label: "Modelo de carta adaptable",
      community: "Nombre de la comunidad u organización cultural",
      address: "Dirección postal",
      place: "Ciudad, país y fecha",
      institution: "Institución o custodio y dirección",
      subject: "solicitud de restitución o retorno de…",
      salutation: "Estimadas y estimados [nombre o equipo de la institución]:",
      mandate: "Representación y mandato",
      withMandate: "Cuando existe un mandato colectivo",
      mandateText:
        "Nos dirigimos a ustedes como [comunidad, familia u organización], representada por [personas y cargos], de acuerdo con un mandato acordado mediante [proceso o resolución]. Esta solicitud se refiere a [persona o entidad], vinculada con [territorio o comunidad].",
      forming: "Cuando el mandato colectivo aún se está construyendo",
      formingText:
        "Nos dirigimos a ustedes como [persona o grupo] para iniciar una conversación sobre [persona o entidad]. Aún estamos identificando las autoridades y relaciones pertinentes. Les pedimos compartir la información necesaria para acompañar ese proceso y no interpretar este primer contacto como un mandato colectivo definitivo.",
      relationship: "Relación y significado",
      relationshipText:
        "Describe la relación, el significado, los nombres y los conocimientos que la comunidad haya decidido compartir. No incluyas conocimientos restringidos o sagrados sin autorización.",
      history: "Historia y separación",
      historyText:
        "Describe lo que se conoce sobre la separación, incluyendo fuentes, fechas e incertidumbres. Si la historia aún no está clara, indícalo.",
      request: "Qué solicitamos",
      requestText:
        "Solicitamos [acción concreta: información, acceso, suspensión de una actividad, transferencia de titularidad o restitución]. Pedimos que [resultado o condiciones deseadas] sean consideradas por [órgano responsable de decidir].",
      interim: "Mientras avanza el proceso",
      interimText:
        "Por ejemplo: pausar la exhibición, el muestreo, la publicación u otro uso mientras se evalúa esta solicitud, si corresponde.",
      records: "Información y antecedentes",
      recordsText:
        "Solicitamos los antecedentes asociados disponibles, incluidos documentos de adquisición, inventarios anteriores, correspondencia, fotografías, investigaciones, registros de conservación, muestras y datos derivados, cuando corresponda.",
      next: "Próximos pasos y respuesta",
      nextText:
        "Agradecemos confirmar la recepción, indicar quiénes y qué órgano tomarán la decisión, explicar el procedimiento aplicable y proponer un plazo para la próxima respuesta antes de [fecha].",
      attachments: "Antecedentes que podrían acompañar la solicitud",
      attachItems: [
        "Una declaración comunitaria u organizacional que indique a quién se representa y cuál es el alcance del mandato.",
        "Una resolución o antecedente de la autoridad correspondiente, si existe.",
        "Una nota sobre cómo se consultará a otras familias, autoridades o personas portadoras de conocimiento.",
      ],
      closing:
        "Estamos disponibles para un diálogo respetuoso y pedimos que se traduzca en responsabilidades, decisiones y pasos claros.",
      signoff: "Atentamente,",
      signature: "Nombres, cargos y firmas que correspondan",
      print: "Imprimir o guardar este modelo",
    };
---

<section class="letter-guide" lang={en ? "en-GB" : "es-CL"} aria-labelledby="letter-guide-title">
  <div class="letter-guide-intro">
    <p class="resource-guide-kicker">{en ? "A working document" : "Un documento de trabajo"}</p>
    <h1>{en ? "Restitution request letter" : "Modelo de carta de solicitud"}</h1>
    <h2 id="letter-guide-title">{en ? "Write from your own relationship" : "Escribe desde tu propia relación"}</h2>
    <p>{copy.intro}</p>
    <button class="letter-print" type="button" onclick="window.print()">
      <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span> {copy.print}
    </button>
  </div>
  <article class="letter-paper" aria-label={copy.label}>
    <header class="letter-paper-header">
      <span>{en ? "MoSA · RESTITUTION" : "MoSA · RESTITUCIÓN"}</span>
      <span>{en ? "A letter to adapt" : "Una carta para adaptar"}</span>
    </header>
    <div class="letter-paper-body">
      <p class="letter-address"><strong>[{copy.community}]</strong><br />[{copy.address}]<br />[{copy.place}]</p>
      <p class="letter-address"><strong>[{copy.institution}]</strong></p>
      <p class="letter-subject"><strong>{en ? "Subject:" : "Asunto:"}</strong> [{copy.subject}]</p>
      <p class="letter-salutation">{copy.salutation}</p>

      <section class="letter-part">
        <h3>{copy.mandate}</h3>
        <h4>{copy.withMandate}</h4>
        <p>{copy.mandateText}</p>
        <h4>{copy.forming}</h4>
        <p>{copy.formingText}</p>
      </section>
      <section class="letter-part"><h3>{copy.relationship}</h3><p>[{copy.relationshipText}]</p></section>
      <section class="letter-part"><h3>{copy.history}</h3><p>[{copy.historyText}]</p></section>
      <section class="letter-part"><h3>{copy.request}</h3><p>{copy.requestText}</p></section>
      <section class="letter-part"><h3>{copy.interim}</h3><p>[{copy.interimText}]</p></section>
      <section class="letter-part"><h3>{copy.records}</h3><p>{copy.recordsText}</p></section>
      <section class="letter-part"><h3>{copy.next}</h3><p>{copy.nextText}</p></section>
      <section class="letter-part">
        <h3>{copy.attachments}</h3>
        <ul>{copy.attachItems.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
      </section>
      <p>{copy.closing}</p>
      <p>{copy.signoff}<br /><strong>[{copy.signature}]</strong></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>

<style>
  .resource-guide-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .letter-guide {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(20rem, 1.3fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    align-items: start;
    margin-block: 3rem 5rem;
  }
  .letter-guide-intro {
    position: sticky;
    top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 0.7rem;
  }
  .letter-guide-intro h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(3.1rem, 4.8vw, 4.9rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    line-height: 0.88;
  }
  .letter-guide-intro h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.2vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.98;
  }
  .letter-guide-intro > p:not(.resource-guide-kicker) {
    max-width: 34ch;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .letter-print {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #000;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .letter-print:hover {
    background: #ff6d6d;
  }
  .letter-paper {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    background: #080808;
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 1.2rem 3rem rgb(0 0 0 / 14%);
  }
  .letter-paper-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.2rem clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #555;
    color: #c5c5c5;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .letter-paper-body {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem) clamp(1.25rem, 7vw, 5.2rem) 4rem;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .letter-paper-body p {
    margin: 0 0 1.3rem;
  }
  .letter-paper-body .letter-address {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .letter-subject {
    padding-block: 0.85rem;
    border-block: 1px solid #555;
  }
  .letter-paper-body .letter-salutation {
    margin-block: 2rem 2.4rem;
  }
  .letter-part {
    margin-block: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #555;
    break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .letter-part h3 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: #ff8585;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
  .letter-part h4 {
    margin: 1.3rem 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .letter-part ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }
  .letter-part li {
    margin-block: 0.6rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .letter-guide {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .letter-guide-intro {
      position: static;
    }
    .letter-guide-intro h2 {
      max-width: 14ch;
    }
  }

  @media print {
    .letter-guide {
      display: block;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .letter-guide-intro,
    .letter-print {
      display: none;
    }
    .letter-paper {
      max-width: none;
      background: #fff;
      color: #000;
      box-shadow: none;
    }
    .letter-paper-header {
      border-color: #999;
      color: #444;
    }
    .letter-paper-body {
      max-width: none;
      padding: 1.5cm 2cm;
      font-size: 11pt;
    }
    .letter-part {
      border-color: #999;
    }
    .letter-part h3 {
      color: #000;
    }
  }
</style>
